WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.211
Today is a short check, and then a game.

2
00:00:02.661 --> 00:00:05.688
Your child reads six words. Then three sentences.

3
00:00:06.138 --> 00:00:07.583
Do not help on this page.

4
00:00:08.033 --> 00:00:12.890
Mark the six words. In the sentences, mark the seven words that are underlined.

5
00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:14.438
Add the two numbers.

6
00:00:14.888 --> 00:00:17.001
Eleven or more, go on to day six.

7
00:00:17.451 --> 00:00:23.308
Fewer than eleven, do days two, three and four again, then come back to this page. That is normal.

8
00:00:23.758 --> 00:00:30.625
Then play the game on the next page. Your child reads along the path, and colors each stone that was read right away.

9
00:00:31.075 --> 00:00:35.070
A stone left white is not a mistake. It is a word to come back to.
